[{"answer":"Good afternoon. Can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Good afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I've just transferred to the School of Education,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd like information about joining the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the School of Education has libraries on two sites, as I'm sure you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/5.mp3"},{"answer":"This one here is the Fordham Site, and the other is on Castle Road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/6.mp3"},{"answer":"And is there any difference between the two libraries?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Not in terms of their facilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Access to online databases and the Internet is available at both sites","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/9.mp3"},{"answer":"and each site has a range of reference materials on education.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes. I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/11.mp3"},{"answer":"But the Castle Road site has books on the sociology of education","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and a collection of textbooks and teaching resources","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/13.mp3"},{"answer":"covering most of the subjects taught in secondary schools.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, right,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/15.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm training to be a primary teacher","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/16.mp3"},{"answer":"so I need to look at materials for the five to eleven age group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you've come to the right place.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/18.mp3"},{"answer":"At Fordham we hold material relating to primary education,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/19.mp3"},{"answer":"as well as special needs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/20.mp3"},{"answer":"but of course you'll need to familiarise yourself with both sites to make the most of our resources.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/21.mp3"},{"answer":"You haven't mentioned periodicals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Are they held at both sites?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Current issues, yes but if you want to look at back issues","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/24.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll need to use the CD-ROM databases which are held here at Fordham.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, about borrowing books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm living out of town, so I'm hoping I can borrow quite a few items,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and cut down on the number of trips I have to make.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, well, members can borrow two books at a time from each site.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Only two books?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Only two from each site, but that's four altogether.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh I see,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and how long can I hang on to them for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/34.mp3"},{"answer":"The borrowing period is one month, but of course books can be renewed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/35.mp3"},{"answer":"You can renew any item a maximum of three times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Do I have to come to the library to do that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/37.mp3"},{"answer":"No, you can do it by telephone or email,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but you can't renew overdue books this way,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/39.mp3"},{"answer":"only before or on the due date stamped in the book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/40.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll need your full name, your borrower number","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/41.mp3"},{"answer":"and the name of the site library you borrowed the items from.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/42.mp3"},{"answer":"So theoretically I can borrow books for up to three months -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/43.mp3"},{"answer":"is that what you're saying?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, provided they're not recalled.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/45.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what happens then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, sometimes an item is requested by another borrower,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/47.mp3"},{"answer":"in which case we'd send you a letter,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/48.mp3"},{"answer":"and you'd have to return the book within seven working days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't forget we're closed on Sundays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I expect it'll take me a while to find what I need.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/52.mp3"},{"answer":"There's such a lot here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there is,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/54.mp3"},{"answer":"but if you need help getting started,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/55.mp3"},{"answer":"this term we're running three study skills workshops.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/57.mp3"},{"answer":"What are they on?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, let me see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/59.mp3"},{"answer":"The first one's on resources...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/60.mp3"},{"answer":"yes, here it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/61.mp3"},{"answer":"How to use the library's resources.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/62.mp3"},{"answer":"That includes everything, not just the print and technical resources.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/63.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds useful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything on using the Internet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, let's see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/66.mp3"},{"answer":"The one on the Internet for beginners was last term.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/67.mp3"},{"answer":"This term it's finding research materials online.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/68.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds interesting too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/69.mp3"},{"answer":"hm, what's the last one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/70.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a workshop on dissertations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/71.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you mean? how to write one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, no it's more to do with academic writing conventions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/73.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, writing a bibliography and how to refer to sources in your text.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/74.mp3"},{"answer":"That sort of thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, here's a leaflet with information about all three.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/77.mp3"},{"answer":"That'll be very useful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/78.mp3"},{"answer":"You're welcome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-3-2023-08-03-14-47-48/79.mp3"}]
